#: ../../config.md:1
msgid "配置"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../config.md:3
msgid "配置分两层：**进程级配置**决定服务怎么跑，**站点设置**决定业务行为。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration has two layers: **process-level config** decides how the "
"service runs, **site settings** decide business behaviour."

