#: ../../config.md:7
msgid ""
"来源优先级：类默认值 → `server/.cfg`（`k=v` 每行一条）→ 环境变量，最后统一校验 "
"（`sapic/basis/conf.py`）。环境变量统一前缀 `sapic_`。"
msgstr ""
"Precedence: class defaults → `server/.cfg` (one `k=v` per line) → "
"environment variables, then validated as a whole (`sapic/basis/conf.py`)."
" Every environment variable uses the `sapic_` prefix."

