"后台「站点设置」页（`PUT /api/v2/settings`，仅管理员）维护，可写键与类型校验在 "
"`sapic/views/settings.py`。前台通过 `GET /api/v2/site` 读取展示字段。"
msgstr ""
"These live in the `settings` table; defaults and validation are "
"centralised in `DEFAULTS` in `sapic/libs/settings.py`, maintained on the "
"admin site-settings page (`PUT /api/v2/settings`, administrators only), "
"with the writable keys and type checks in `sapic/views/settings.py`. The "
"front end reads the display fields through `GET /api/v2/site`."

