#: ../../config.md:51
msgid "几个容易踩的点："
msgstr "A few gotchas:"

#: ../../config.md:53
msgid ""
"`upload_fetch_proxy` 是**兜底**代理：直连拿到可用图片就不碰它，只有这一次直连「没拿到可用响应」 "
"才用它重试一次——包括超时 / 连接错误 / 本地解析不了，以及被反爬或地区限制时边缘节点直接回的 4xx/5xx、还有 200 但内容是 "
"HTML 的拦截页。填一个 `http://` 或 `https://` 代理地址，需要认证写 "
"`http://user:password@host:port`；socks 不支持（`urllib` 只认 http/https）。 目前只有 "
"URL 上传的服务端抓取会用到它，存储后端的内部地址永远直连。 两次都失败时错误消息带原因（如 `remote fetch failed: "
"http 403` / `... : network error`）， 服务端日志里还有一行 `direct url fetch failed "
"(...), retrying via proxy` 说明确实兜底了。"
msgstr ""
"`upload_fetch_proxy` is a **fallback** proxy: a direct connection that "
"returns a usable image is never routed through it, and only a direct "
"attempt with no usable response is retried through it once — timeouts, "
"connection errors and local resolution failures, plus 4xx/5xx returned by"
" edge nodes because of anti-scraping or regional limits, and 200 "
"responses whose body is an HTML block page. Point it at an `http://` or "
"`https://` proxy; with authentication use "
"`http://user:password@host:port`. Socks is not supported (`urllib` only "
"knows http/https). Today only server-side fetching for URL uploads uses "
"it; internal addresses of storage backends always connect directly. When "
"both attempts fail the message carries the reason (e.g. `remote fetch "
"failed: http 403` / `... : network error`), and the server log has a "
"`direct url fetch failed (...), retrying via proxy` line confirming the "
"fallback."

#: ../../config.md:61
msgid "`upload_count_limit` 是**单次批次**的前端队列限制，后端每次请求只处理一个文件， 想限制「每天能传多少」要另立语义。"
msgstr ""
"`upload_count_limit` is a **per-batch** limit on the front-end queue; the"
" backend handles one file per request, so limiting e.g. uploads per day "
"needs a different concept."

#: ../../config.md:63
msgid "`image_expire_max_days` 一旦大于 0，就不允许再创建永久图片，未指定时按上限处理。"
msgstr ""
"Once `image_expire_max_days` is greater than 0, permanent images can no "
"longer be created; an unspecified expiry is clamped to the limit."

#: ../../config.md:64
msgid "`allow_video` 关掉后视频后缀直接拒收；后缀白名单仍是第一道门。"
msgstr ""
"With `allow_video` off, video extensions are rejected outright; the "
"extension allowlist remains the first gate."

#: ../../config.md:65
msgid "`password_login` 关掉后本地登录与注册接口直接 403，只剩统一登录入口。"
msgstr ""
"With `password_login` off, the local login and registration endpoints "
"return 403 and only single sign-on remains."

#: ../../config.md:66
msgid ""
"`site_announcement`（全站公告）只解析三种排版：`**加粗**`、`[文字](https://链接)`、 "
"空行分段（单换行也换行）。链接只认 `http(s)://` 与 `mailto:`，其余写法按原文显示； 它是纯文本语法，**不执行任何 "
"HTML 标签**（前端用节点构造渲染，没有 `v-html`）。"
msgstr ""
"`site_announcement` (the global announcement) understands only three "
"things: `**bold**`, `[text](https://link)` and blank-line paragraphs "
"(single newlines also break lines). Links only accept `http(s)://` and "
"`mailto:`; anything else is shown verbatim. It is plain-text syntax and "
"**never executes HTML tags** (the front end builds nodes, there is no "
"`v-html`)."

#: ../../config.md:69
msgid "新增配置项必须同时接进「后台表单 + 实际生效点」，不要留下只存不用的开关。"
msgstr ""
"A new config option must be wired into both the admin form and the code "
"path that uses it — no switches that only store a value."

